Z||000006||SLYGUY||11-06-2001||01:14 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero_24:<P><B>It was so much easier to shift with the old shifter back in place.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I like the feel of the shifter at it's stock height, and from what I've read shortening it will increase shifting effort. I'll stick with the stock height too!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<p>[This message has been edited by SLYGUY (edited 11-06-2001).]||||reg||1
